jobs.content:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join the Rest Revolution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world is wired and tired. It&#39;s plagued by screens, notifications, and the sense that you should always be doing ... something. But hey, you&#39;re reading this job application right now, so you probably know exactly what we&#39;re talking about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So here&#39;s a bit of good news amidst all the noise: Hatch is a sleep wellness company that&#39;s betting on rest in a culture obsessed with optimization. While most technology is designed to keep you engaged, our devices use the science of habit formation to help people unplug, unwind, and recharge. Through genuinely enjoyable routines, habit building, and gentle guidance (no sleep scores or wearables here), we help people build healthier sleep habits and feel the difference in everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than a decade ago, we started with a mission to help parents navigate the complexities of newborn sleep. Today, we&#39;re helping more than 5 million people (and counting) take care of themselves and the people they love through the power of rest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re open to candidates across the U.S. and Canada. However, please note that Hatch is based in California, so we just ask that you&#39;re available during PST/PDT hours.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Hatch, Accounting is at an inflection point. We have a growing hardware-and-subscription business, meaningful direct and retail sales and inventory complexity, and a lean internal team supported by specialized external partners. We are looking for an Accounting Manager, Operations &amp;amp; Transformation to serve as a critical partner to our Financial Controller and help build the next version of our Accounting function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will own the day-to-day operating rhythm of Accounting: leading the monthly close; reviewing journal entries and reconciliations; managing external accounting, payroll, and tax partners; strengthening cash and payroll controls; coordinating recurring tax compliance; supporting Finance-side 401(k) administration; and redesigning manual processes into scalable, well-documented workflows. Routine payroll processing is supported by a specialist provider; this role retains internal governance, review, final approval, and accountability for the related accounting. This is a hands-on role for someone who enjoys making complex processes understandable, measurable, and better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Within 1 month:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn the landscape.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a working understanding of Hatch’s business model, accounting systems, close calendar, key controls, and external-provider workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own payroll and 401(k) governance.&lt;/strong&gt; Review payroll variances and exceptions, provide final internal approval, oversee related reconciliations, and coordinate Finance-side plan administration and issue resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish effective working relationships across Finance, People, Operations, Supply Chain, and our external accounting and payroll partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish the baseline.&lt;/strong&gt; Assess close timing, recurring rework, manual touchpoints, critical reconciliations, and the highest-risk payroll, cash, and control processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Within 3 months:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the monthly close.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the close operating cadence, review standards, issue escalation, and timely completion of accurate, audit-ready workpapers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own tax compliance coordination.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the company’s tax calendar and oversee timely, accurate monthly, quarterly, and annual sales and use tax filings, reconciliations, remittances, registrations, and notices. Coordinate federal and state income tax filing support with external tax advisers, partner with the R&amp;amp;D team on credit tracking and documentation, and resolve payroll withholding matters that fall outside the payroll platform or external payroll provider’s scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen cash and payment controls.&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as an authorized approver, improve dual-control coverage, and ensure critical treasury activities have clear backup procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch the transformation roadmap.&lt;/strong&gt; Prioritize the processes that will most meaningfully shorten the close, reduce manual effort, and improve accuracy; begin delivering the first automation and workflow improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;After 6 months:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve close efficiency.&lt;/strong&gt; Reduce days to close and the manual effort, rework, and coordination required to complete a standard month-end while maintaining strong accuracy and controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver measurable automation.&lt;/strong&gt; Implement at least three meaningful process or automation improvements with clear evidence of time saved, fewer errors, or reduced rework.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build reliable tax operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear ownership, documented procedures, and audit-ready support across recurring tax filings, remittances, registrations, notices, income tax requests, and R&amp;amp;D credit reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise partner performance.&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the accuracy, documentation, timeliness, and reviewability of external-provider deliverables while reducing issues that require Controller intervention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build resilient operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain dependable coverage across payroll, cash, payments, 401(k), close, and other critical Accounting activities, and help shape the right long-term mix of internal ownership, specialist support, and technology-enabled workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of progressive Accounting experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You have operated in fast-moving environments and have meaningful experience reviewing others’ work and leading people, projects, or external teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong accounting fundamentals.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring a solid command of U.S. GAAP, journal entries, balance-sheet reconciliations, month-end close, financial-statement preparation, and internal controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on close leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to diagnose bottlenecks, raise workpaper quality, prioritize critical-path items, and move a team toward a faster, more sustainable close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll governance experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You have reviewed and approved payroll, investigated variances and exceptions, overseen payroll accounting, and partnered effectively with People and payroll specialists. Experience with multi-state payroll and 401(k) administration is strongly valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Treasury and control judgment.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable reviewing payment runs, approving payroll and cash disbursements, and maintaining appropriate segregation of duties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tax compliance coordination.&lt;/strong&gt; You can manage recurring compliance calendars, assemble accurate and audit-ready support, work effectively with external tax advisers, and drive open tax matters through resolution. Experience with multi-state sales and use tax, income tax compliance, R&amp;amp;D credits, and payroll tax matters is strongly valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External-partner leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You can set clear expectations, review quality, track recurring issues, and improve an outsourced or distributed team without simply taking all the work back yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and systems orientation.&lt;/strong&gt; You can map a process, identify the real control points, translate Accounting requirements into repeatable workflows, and lead testing and implementation of automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication and documentation.&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain complex Accounting issues in plain language, create practical procedures, and work credibly with auditors, vendors, and cross-functional leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You are curious, low ego, calm under pressure, and motivated by making the operating system better—not by preserving unnecessary complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant business-model experience is a plus.&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with SaaS or subscriptions, inventory and COGS, direct e-commerce and retail sales, third-party logistics, and ASC 606 will help you ramp quickly. Experience with NetSuite, Bill.com, FloQast, Rippling, Shopify, Amazon Seller, or similar platforms is also helpful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education.&lt;/strong&gt; A bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field—or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Monthly Internet reimbursement allowance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Friends and Family discount on our products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Discount program from popular brands in travel, entertainment and retail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Many other spontaneous perks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why You’ll Love Working at Hatch&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a certified Great Place to Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We help people sleep better. Our products make a real, meaningful difference in our customers’ lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our team is collaborative, fun, and full of brilliant minds, and you’ll work with leadership that truly values every contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re backed by world-class investors (and growing fast)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a remote-friendly work environment. We practice what we preach to give our employees better balance and more flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Perks &amp;amp; Benefits That Matter&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% paid medical, dental, and vision insurance for employees (80% for dependents, including domestic partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful equity. You’re an owner here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) match with no vesting schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;16 free therapy sessions (for you and one other adult in your life)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial support for family planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote office and monthly internet reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friends and family discounts on Hatch products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exclusive discounts on travel, entertainment, and top retail brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Hatch&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hatch was founded in 2014 by entrepreneurs (and parents themselves) Ann Crady Weiss and Dave Weiss. Headquartered in Menlo Park, California, Hatch creates tech that helps you and your family get better sleep.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hatch Sleep Clock is a contactless sleep tracker that provides actionable insights, personalized recommendations, and bedtime routines based on your unique sleep habits and preferences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Restore 3&lt;/strong&gt; helps you regulate your nervous system and tune into your circadian rhythm with unwind routines, science-backed sleep audio, and ambient lights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hatch Baby&lt;/strong&gt; helps parents soothe their little ones and create healthy sleep habits with expert sleep support, gentle sounds, and calming lights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hatch Go &lt;/strong&gt;includes ten soothing sounds in one portable package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We welcome applicants of all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Help the World Sleep Better?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d love to hear from you! Apply now and join us in making great sleep a reality for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Verify&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hatch participates in E-Verify and will provide the federal government with your Form I-9 information to confirm that you are authorized to work in the U.S.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting a job application at Hatch, you agree to our privacy notice, located &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hatch.co/employment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join the Rest Revolution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world is wired and tired. It&#39;s plagued by screens, notifications, and the sense that you should always be doing ... something. But hey, you&#39;re reading this job application right now, so you probably know exactly what we&#39;re talking about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So here&#39;s a bit of good news amidst all the noise: Hatch is a sleep wellness company that&#39;s betting on rest in a culture obsessed with optimization. While most technology is designed to keep you engaged, our devices use the science of habit formation to help people unplug, unwind, and recharge. Through genuinely enjoyable routines, habit building, and gentle guidance (no sleep scores or wearables here), we help people build healthier sleep habits and feel the difference in everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than a decade ago, we started with a mission to help parents navigate the complexities of newborn sleep. Today, we&#39;re helping more than 5 million people (and counting) take care of themselves and the people they love through the power of rest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re open to candidates across the U.S. and Canada. However, please note that Hatch is based in California, so we just ask that you&#39;re available during PST/PDT hours.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: How You&#39;ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Backend Engineering | &lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Director, Backend &amp;amp; DevOps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll build, ship, and operate the backend behind Hatch&#39;s mobile apps and IoT devices. That means Java and Python REST APIs, AWS IoT, Lambda, and the monitoring, alerting, and DevOps practices that keep millions of devices humming in real homes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You’re a great fit if you thrive in environments of rapid learning and delivery.&amp;nbsp; You’re self-motivated and have demonstrated strong ownership and self-direction.&amp;nbsp; You strive to understand the business of what we are trying to accomplish and push engineering solutions to provide customer value.&amp;nbsp; We&#39;re a small team, and AI-assisted development is core to how we work. We expect you to ramp up quickly, use AI every day, and deliver steadily in the areas you own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work with Mobile, Embedded, and Product to build features end to end, from cloud APIs to the devices themselves. You&#39;ll contribute to system design and help shape how the backend grows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days: Learn &amp;amp; Contribute&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn our backend architecture and tools through team walkthroughs and your own exploration, and share what you notice and what you&#39;d ask&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn what drives the business and use it to weigh tradeoffs in your own work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ship well-scoped backend features and fixes in our Spring Boot + Hibernate stack, using AI to speed up delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join architecture and design discussions, ask questions, and contribute ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build working relationships with peers across Mobile, Embedded, and Product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6 Months: Deliver Independently&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn the end-to-end flow of the backend areas you work in, including how they interact with the app and device firmware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Be the main driver for medium-sized features, from design through deployment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own a component within a core area such as IoT device communication, registration/auth flows, device routine scheduling, or backend support for mobile app features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and fix production issues in your areas, and escalate early when a problem is bigger than it looks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Add or improve monitoring and alerting using Graphite, ELK, or other internal tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First Year: Own an Area&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own a backend area and handle most questions and issues in it without escalating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the design and delivery of a large project, with guidance from senior engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Find and make improvements to reliability, test coverage, and developer experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Help onboard new teammates, and pass on what you&#39;ve learned through code reviews and documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Essentials&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of backend engineering experience, with strong skills in JVM languages. Spring Boot, Groovy and Python backend experience is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt; building and maintaining RESTful JSON APIs in production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
