&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take over management of the mobile engineering managers, and start building the relationships and 1:1 cadence to support them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as the owner of the weekly Mobile Strategy meeting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get oriented across all four teams - Adult, Kids, Foundations, and Growth - and understand current resourcing, roadmap, and delivery status in each team&lt;/li&gt;
