&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our Finance team is looking for an FP&amp;amp;A Manager to join us in helping people get their best sleep yet. Reporting to the Director of FP&amp;amp;A, you’ll serve as a strategic finance partner and analytical engine for our business, owning revenue forecasting, demand planning, and subscription and LTV analytics, and partnering across key functions including Marketing, Retail, Operations, Analytics, and Accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact role for someone who thrives at the intersection of rigorous financial modeling and cross-functional influence. You’ll be building the analytical frameworks that drive how we invest, operate, and grow—and you’ll bring a point of view to every conversation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Forecasting &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own the driver-based revenue model end to end, from units and sell-through to registrations, subscriptions and revenue, for monthly pacing and quarterly forecasts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the annual revenue budget and long-range plan, including scenarios that size the revenue and LTV impact of key investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Run monthly actualization and forecast cycles through our FP&amp;amp;A platform (Datarails), keeping assumptions, scenarios and versions organized and auditable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support board and investor reporting with revenue, demand and subscription metrics (units by channel, paid subscribers, ARR, attach) and a clear story on performance and outlook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subscription &amp;amp; LTV Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Model and track attach, conversion and retention, and maintain lifetime value and cohort contribution by product and channel, the lens Marketing uses to optimize acquisition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
