&lt;h2&gt;About Hatch&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hatch was founded in 2014 by entrepreneurs (and parents themselves) Ann Crady Weiss and Dave Weiss. Headquartered in Menlo Park, California, Hatch creates tech that helps you and your family get better sleep.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hatch Sleep Clock is a contactless sleep tracker that provides actionable insights, personalized recommendations, and bedtime routines based on your unique sleep habits and preferences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Restore 3&lt;/strong&gt; helps you regulate your nervous system and tune into your circadian rhythm with unwind routines, science-backed sleep audio, and ambient lights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hatch Baby&lt;/strong&gt; helps parents soothe their little ones and create healthy sleep habits with expert sleep support, gentle sounds, and calming lights&lt;/li&gt;
