&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn Faster&lt;/strong&gt; 👟&lt;em&gt; (ship small features iteratively, learn, and commit to the next step)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
